<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 12.77 to close at 7290.69.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.99 to 436.21.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.10.</p>
<p>Advances led declines 1420 to 1108.</p>
<p>Volume was 537,049,360 compared with 447,165,150 on Tuesday.</p>
